<title>AUSTRIA: Vienna to suspend trade in Verbund Aug 28.</title>
<headline>Vienna to suspend trade in Verbund Aug 28.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Vienna stock exchange said on Monday it was suspending trading in the shares and options of national utility Oesterreichische Elektrizitaetswirtschafts-AG (Verbund) for 45 minutes on Wednesday morning.</p>
<p>Verbund asked the stock exchange to suspend its shares until 0815 GMT on Wednesday ahead of the release of its first-half earnings, the bourse said.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 258</p>
</text>
